#: org.kde.kuiviewerpart.metainfo.xml:19
#. (itstool) path: component/name
msgid "KUIViewer KPart"
msgstr "KUIViewer KPart"

#: org.kde.kuiviewerpart.metainfo.xml:20
#. (itstool) path: component/summary
msgid "Qt Designer UI File Viewer in KParts-using software"
msgstr "KParts-इत्यत्र Qt Designer UI File Viewer इति सॉफ्टवेयरस्य उपयोगेन"

#: org.kde.kuiviewerpart.metainfo.xml:22
#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"The KUIViewer KPart allows KParts-using software to display and check user "
"interface (.ui) files created in Qt Designer."
msgstr ""
"KUIViewer KPart KParts-उपयोगं कुर्वन्तं सॉफ्टवेयरं Qt Designer मध्ये "
"निर्मितानाम् उपयोक्तृ-अन्तरफलक (.ui) सञ्चिकानां प्रदर्शनं जाँचं च कर्तुं "
"शक्नोति ।"